<title>USA: Class actions vs IEC Electronics withdrawn.</title>
<headline>Class actions vs IEC Electronics withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.Y. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>IEC Electronics Corp said a group of shareholders had &quot;voluntarily&quot; withdrawn consolidated class actions against the company.</p>
<p>The group had filed the actions on March 23, 1994, alleging the company had violated various federal securities laws, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The actions ... have been voluntarily discontinued without any payment to the plaintiffs or to their counsel,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The company, which makes electronic products, said it did not know the reason for the group's decision to withdraw the actions.</p>
</text>
